# aux-fixed-after: Can an aux column share its name with an earlier fixed quantity (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: f=7 g=3
# pc: ok
# ruling: pc-ode accepts it. The aux column keeps its own formula and every formula that reads `f` gets the fixed quantity, so `aux g=f` is 2*x+1 (language.md, Names and order).
x'=-x
x(0)=1
f=2*x+1
aux f=7*x
aux g=f
@ total=1,dt=0.5
